---
description: Haven development workflow and source ownership
alwaysApply: true
---

- Read `AGENTS.md`, `AGENT_WORKBOOK.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/SECURITY.md`, and `docs/TASKS.md` before editing.
- Record active work in `AGENT_WORKBOOK.md` before material changes and update it with completed changes, validation, and blockers at handoff. Preserve other entries and never record secrets or sensitive user content.
- Run `npm run verify` before handing off a code change. Use `npm run dev` for browser smoke testing.
- Keep routes in `src/app/`, reusable UI in `src/components/`, and domain helpers in `src/lib/`.
- Validate client mutations with Zod and treat localStorage as demonstration persistence only.
- Add behavioral tests under `tests/` and update documentation when a public contract or user-visible capability changes.
- Do not edit generated output under `.next/` or dependencies under `node_modules/`.
- Keep each change aligned to one ticket in `docs/TASKS.md`.
